---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// Early-access confirmation. The /early-access form redirects here after a
// successful submission. When Stripe checkout goes live, give checkout its own
// /welcome page with trial copy rather than reusing this one (see STRIPE-SETUP.md).
---

<Base
  title="You're on the list | ScamPrep"
  description="You're on the ScamPrep early-access list. Here's what happens next."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap center" style="max-width: 640px;">
      <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="16" fill="none" stroke="#121110" stroke-width="3" />
        <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="10" fill="none" stroke="#121110" stroke-width="1.6" opacity="0.45" />
        <line x1="20" y1="20" x2="30.6" y2="9.4" stroke="#121110" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="5.5" fill="#f0a11c" />
      </svg>
      <h1>You're on the list.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-inline: auto;">
        Thanks — you're in line for the founding cohort. Family plans open this fall, and
        early-access members hear from us first.
      </p>
      <div class="card" style="text-align: left; margin-top: 32px;">
        <h3>What happens next</h3>
        <ol class="next-steps">
          <li><strong>We'll confirm by email</strong> in the next day or two — a real person (usually the founder) reads every signup.</li>
          <li><strong>When your cohort opens</strong>, you get first pick of enrollment dates and white-glove setup for the person you care about.</li>
          <li><strong>They opt in — always.</strong> Nothing to install, nothing to download, and consent comes first.</li>
        </ol>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-soft);">
          Questions in the meantime? Write
          <a href="mailto:hello@getscamprep.com">hello@getscamprep.com</a> — and when plans open,
          every one will carry a 60-day money-back guarantee.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .next-steps { padding-left: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .next-steps li { margin-bottom: 0.7em; }
</style>
